    "changes": "Package/build metadata adapted for Paper Factory. responses.ts permits a bounded twenty-five-minute stream for long research responses; the app applies its shorter deadline to other phases. response-deadline.test.mjs adds synthetic regression coverage. Other upstream source/tests are unchanged."
